@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5055
@apiKey = replace-with-local-environment-value
@deliveryId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Delivery before or after assignment
GET {{baseUrl}}/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Assign an available courier
POST {{baseUrl}}/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/assign-courier
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Actor-Id: demo-operator
X-Actor-Role: operator
X-Correlation-Id: manual-demo

{
  "requestId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555",
  "courierId": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
  "expectedVersion": 1
}

### Unavailable courier
POST {{baseUrl}}/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/assign-courier
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-Actor-Id: demo-operator
X-Actor-Role: operator

{
  "requestId": "66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666",
  "courierId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999",
  "expectedVersion": 1
}

